          "special": {
            "value": "You can't select another dedication feat until you have gained two other feats from the oracle archetype.\nLeads to: Basic Mysteries|APG, Advanced Mysteries|APG, Basic Oracle Spellcasting|APG, Expert Oracle Spellcasting|APG, Master Oracle Spellcasting|APG, Mysterious Breadth|APG, First Revelation|APG"
