                      "value": "You gain your mystery's initial revelation spell. Casting this spell progresses your oracular curse. Use the minor curse from your mystery, but when you progress it again, instead of your mystery's moderate curse effect, you become flat-footed in addition to the effects of the minor curse.\n\nIf you don't have one, you gain a focus pool of 1 Focus Point.\n\nYou can Refocus by reconciling the conflicting nature of your mystery, which also reduces your curse to minor."
